{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37351","headline":"赠孟德茂 · 唐彦谦","name":"赠孟德茂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江海悠悠雪欲飞，抱书空出又空归。\n沙头人满鸥应笑，船上酒香鱼正肥。\n尘土竟成谁计是，山林又悔一年非。\n平生万卷应夫子，两世功名穷布衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37351.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37351","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}